What are Electric Garden Tools?
Electric garden tools encompass battery-powered or corded devices designed for landscaping tasks including lawn mowing, hedge trimming, leaf blowing, and chainsaw operations. These tools provide eco-friendly alternatives to traditional gas-powered equipment, offering reduced emissions, lower noise pollution, and improved operational efficiency for both residential and professional users.

